---
import EventGroupPage from '../components/EventGroupPage.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<EventGroupPage sectionKey="family" title="Family Events" active="family-events" pageMark="👪">
  Stories tied to a specific <a href={`${base}families`}>family class</a> — the Champions, Clerics,
  Hunters, Landowners, Patrons, Riders, Sages, Statesmen, Traders and Artisans. These fire only for
  (or are about) a family of that class, from Family Traditions to class-flavoured diplomacy and city
  events. The trigger chip names the family class. Unlike the wonder / project / building pages, this
  is a <strong>cross-cut view</strong>: each of these stories also appears under its own event class or
  trigger on <a href={`${base}events`}>Story Events</a>. Weights are the XML knob, not real in-game
  odds — character and empire conditions filter what's eligible.
</EventGroupPage>
